            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 157 is on track to ship new return value of Promise for alarms.clearAll().</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chromium CL 8182627: <a href=\"https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8182627\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8182627</a></p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">WECG discussion: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5034727818\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1055\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/1055/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1055\">w3c/webextensions#1055</a><br>\nMDN Content PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5675224490\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45951\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45951/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45951\">mdn/content#45951</a><br>\nEarlier BCD update for Firefox 157: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5378227445\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30450\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30450/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30450\">#30450</a></p>\n\n",
