        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add missing compatibility data for the <code class=\"notranslate\">raw-string</code> subfeature of CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">attr()</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Details</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add <code class=\"notranslate\">css.types.attr.raw-string</code>.</li>\n<li>Chrome support starts in 136.</li>\n<li>Firefox support starts in 138.</li>\n<li>Safari support starts in 26.</li>\n<li>Add the CSS Values and Units Level 5 specification reference.</li>\n<li>Keep <code class=\"notranslate\">type_function.string</code> unchanged because <code class=\"notranslate\">type(&lt;string&gt;)</code> is a separate feature.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30618.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5547941376\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30618\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30618/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30618\">#30618</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30704",
            "title": "fix(css): add attr raw-string compatibility data",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-01T10:05:57.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-29T20:25:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "BHUVANSH855",
